6A4kGNIHxy3T1V-1tci7NZfJ1kN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0nwz9NvEA6Fgs99p9HyKv_JIiomIhunixRAApVFqqtcQ&oe=69F0CD2E"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot_03_2560x1440.png", "id": "1956694731931275", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298150_1956694735264608_4901817897400918377_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=79y7MqoTKqQQ7kNvwGDqftp&_nc_oc=AdryPcdmgF4z7cpCuVQ28Ndelr-XSVLxgKBiCheyuhwVMYs4m6DVGVczoM9xsXXaZwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2G7rm6mlnIy_-QGB33S9c9pO2bzYByHFaGnK5gAoh28w&oe=69F0B21C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Brainrot Survival", "keywords": ["MR", "Passthrough", "Meme", "Shooter", "Arcade"], "long_description": "# **Shatter your walls. Rescue the Brainrot.**\n\nWatch your room's physical boundaries crumble to reveal deep space. **Mow down hundreds of enemies** swarming the void outside your walls in this high-density **MR Space Shooter**.\n{748217571349302}\nEngage in intense **Passthrough Combat** to **rescue the Brainrot**\u2014your only goal is to save them from destruction. This isn't just a game; it's the ultimate **stress-relieving MR experience** where you defend the Brainrot from the safety of your living room.\n\n---\n\n### **Game Features:**\n{1419686969866160}\n* **Insane Scale:** Face **hundreds of enemies on screen** simultaneously in the deep space outside your walls.\n\n{886175917646318}\n* **Window to War:** Your walls disappear, turning your room into a safe haven overlooking the galactic battlefield.\n\n{2969329879923652}\n* **Rescue the Brainrot:** Snatch the legendary Brainrot characters from the enemy clutches before they are lost forever.\n\n{1274194554554068}\n{1479114093555059}", "short_description": "Shatter your walls. Rescue the Brainrot.\n\nWatch your walls crumble to reveal deep space in this high-density MR Space Shooter. Mow down hundreds of enemies swarming the void outside your room in intense 